  "description": "MinerU document extraction — convert PDFs, scanned documents, images, Word (DOC/DOCX), PowerPoint (PPT/PPTX), and web pages into clean Markdown, HTML, LaTeX, or DOCX. MinerU is an all-in-one CLI tool and agent skill for reliable, high-fidelity document parsing.",
